        }
      }
    },
    "Changing DNS uses the chosen provider's categories. To use Hisn's own list, point the router and its clients to an always-on filtering server that imports Hisn's verified rules. This guide does not establish direct list upload on your model." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يستخدم تغيير DNS فئات المزوّد المختار. لاستخدام قائمة حصن، وجّه الراوتر وأجهزته إلى خادم فلترة يعمل باستمرار ويستورد قواعد حصن المتحقق منها. لا يؤكد هذا الدليل إمكانية رفع القائمة مباشرةً إلى موديل جهازك."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changing DNS uses the chosen provider's categories. To use Hisn's own list, point the router and its clients to an always-on filtering server that imports Hisn's verified rules. This guide does not establish direct list upload on your model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
