            "value" : "Find my router"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find the manufacturer and model on the router label or in its official app. An internet provider may restrict DNS settings. Choose the matching guide, or continue protecting this device." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ابحث عن الشركة والموديل على ملصق الراوتر أو في تطبيقه الرسمي. قد يقيّد مزوّد الإنترنت إعدادات DNS. اختر الدليل المناسب أو تابع حماية هذا الجهاز."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find the manufacturer and model on the router label or in its official app. An internet provider may restrict DNS settings. Choose the matching guide, or continue protecting this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find the model on the device label or in its official app. Do not enter passwords or serial numbers. These details stay in this setup screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ستجد الموديل على ملصق الجهاز أو في تطبيقه الرسمي. لا تُدخل كلمات المرور أو الأرقام التسلسلية. تبقى هذه التفاصيل في شاشة الإعداد هذه."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find the model on the device label or in its official app. Do not enter passwords or serial numbers. These details stay in this setup screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find your exact D-Link model and hardware revision in the official support center. Use its manual to locate Internet DNS and client DHCP DNS settings; a menu path from another D-Link model may not apply." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ابحث عن موديل D-Link وإصدار الجهاز بدقة في مركز الدعم الرسمي. استخدم دليله لتحديد إعدادات DNS للإنترنت وللأجهزة عبر DHCP؛ قد لا تصلح تعليمات موديل آخر."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find your exact D-Link model and hardware revision in the official support center. Use its manual to locate Internet DNS and client DHCP DNS settings; a menu path from another D-Link model may not apply."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finding a router or opening its page does not verify blocking. After setup, use the DNS check below and test each device separately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "العثور على الراوتر أو فتح صفحته لا يؤكد عمل الحجب. بعد الإعداد، استخدم فحص DNS أدناه واختبر كل جهاز على حدة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finding a router or opening its page does not verify blocking. After setup, use the DNS check below and test each device separately."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fixed commitment until the chosen deadline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
