            "value" : "Fixed commitment until the chosen deadline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For Archer wireless routers, look under Advanced > Network > Internet. DSL models may use LAN Settings instead. Use the official guide for your hardware version; Deco has a separate app guide." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "في راوترات Archer اللاسلكية، ابحث ضمن Advanced > Network > Internet. قد تستخدم موديلات DSL قسم LAN Settings بدلًا منه. اتبع الدليل الرسمي لإصدار جهازك؛ ولـ Deco دليل مستقل لتطبيق الهاتف."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For Archer wireless routers, look under Advanced > Network > Internet. DSL models may use LAN Settings instead. Use the official guide for your hardware version; Deco has a separate app guide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For upstream DNS, use Internet > Account Information > DNS Server. For a local filtering server, use Home Network > Network > Network Settings and the IPv4/IPv6 DNS advertisement settings. The official guide explains both routes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لإعداد DNS الخارجي استخدم Internet > Account Information > DNS Server. ولخادم فلترة محلي، استخدم Home Network > Network > Network Settings وإعدادات إعلان DNS للأجهزة عبر IPv4 وIPv6. يشرح الدليل الرسمي الطريقتين."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For upstream DNS, use Internet > Account Information > DNS Server. For a local filtering server, use Home Network > Network > Network Settings and the IPv4/IPv6 DNS advertisement settings. The official guide explains both routes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forced for Google, YouTube, Bing, DuckDuckGo and Brave Search in every browser and app." : {
