            "value" : "iCloud Private Relay"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If macOS asks, allow the filter under System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إن طلب النظام ذلك، اسمح بالمرشّح من إعدادات النظام › عام › عناصر تسجيل الدخول والامتدادات."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the gateway supports firewall rules, your administrator can restrict outside DNS separately for IPv4 and IPv6. DNS settings alone do not prevent encrypted DNS or VPN bypass. Keep the router password with your trusted person and plan recovery before restricting access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا كانت بوابة الشبكة تدعم قواعد جدار الحماية، يستطيع المسؤول تقييد DNS الخارجي لكل من IPv4 وIPv6 على حدة. إعدادات DNS وحدها لا تمنع التجاوز عبر DNS المشفّر أو VPN. احتفظ بكلمة مرور الراوتر لدى شخصك الموثوق وجهّز طريقة الاستعادة قبل تقييد الوصول."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the gateway supports firewall rules, your administrator can restrict outside DNS separately for IPv4 and IPv6. DNS settings alone do not prevent encrypted DNS or VPN bypass. Keep the router password with your trusted person and plan recovery before restricting access."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Immediate, and never without them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فورًا، ولا يتم أبدًا دونه."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Google Home, select the network's Wi-Fi settings, then Advanced networking > DNS > Custom. Enter the chosen filtering DNS addresses and save. Use Google's guide for the current app layout." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
